CHIP MATRIX MACH211
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=B*C*D*/E+/A*C*D*E+/B*C*/D+/C*/F+A*E+A*/B*/C*E+/D*E
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=D*E+A*D+A*/C*/E*/F+E*F+B*/C*F+C*/D*/E*F+/A*B*/D
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(C*/F+B*D*E*/F+/B*E+/B*/D*/E*/F+/A*B*F+A*/D+A*/C*/E*/F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=/A*/B+/A*F+A*/C*D*F+/D*E*/F+/B*/C*D*E+D*/E+/A*/D
